OL,3,GNEWSATwitchers raise cash to give
OL,4,Avillagers tweet relief
OL,5,
OL,6,FBirdwatchers are raising money to "give
OL,7,Fsomething back" to the village where
OL,8,Fhundreds of them flocked following a
OL,9,Frare sighting.
OL,11,FEnthusiasts have been travelling to
OL,12,FMundesley in Norfolk since a northern
OL,13,Fnutcracker was spotted in a garden on
OL,14,FFriday.
OL,16,FWayne Glossop, who travelled from
OL,17,FRotherham in South Yorkshire to see the
OL,18,Fbird on Sunday, said a villager
OL,19,Fsuggested raising money for the
OL,20,FMundesley Volunteer Inshore Lifeboat -
OL,21,Fand the idea prompted him to set up a
OL,22,Fcrowdfunding page.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
